To run this server, save the code in a file (e.g., `main.py`), and then run the following command in your terminal:

```
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

This will start the FastAPI server on your local machine. You can access the endpoints by navigating to `http://127.0.0.1:8000/` and `http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/{some_integer}` in your web browser.

